  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mt. Bulusan Eruption Emergency Relief Operation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The phreatic eruption of Mt. Bulusan left villages in a blanket of thick ashes in Juban, Sorsogon, Bicol Region, Philippines. Around 2784 families were affected due to the hazardous ashfalls. This Relief fund will support Emergency Relief Delivery operations composed of food, water, medicines, face masks, and hygiene kits. The response will be implemented by Tarabang para sa Bicol (TABI) and with the support of the Local Government Unit.</narrative>
  </description>
